  "whatsapp_greeting": "\ud83d\udc4b Welcome to DALCORE Assistant on WhatsApp!\n\nI'm your AI construction management brain with three research modes:\n\n\ud83d\udcca **Company Data** - Analyze your projects and financials\n\ud83d\udd04 **Blended** - Company data + industry benchmarks\n\ud83c\udf10 **Web Research** - Industry trends and best practices\n\nI can help you:\n\n\ud83d\udcca Analyze project financials and CTC\n\ud83d\udcc5 Review schedules and deadlines\n\u26a0\ufe0f Identify risks and issues\n\ud83d\udcb0 Track cash flow and profitability\n\ud83d\udcc4 Search documents and contracts\n\ud83d\udd0d Research industry standards\n\u270f\ufe0f Create tasks, risks, daily logs, and change orders\n\nJust ask me anything about your projects or the construction industry!\n\nWhat would you like to know?",
